description: TiendaMax tax engine — invariants and review posture
alwaysApply: true
---

Graded take-home. Context lives in `docs/`. Read `docs/00-CONTEXT.md` (rubric +
locked decisions) and `docs/01-GAP-ANALYSIS.md` (what is missing) before
proposing changes. Task list with file paths: `docs/02-BUILD-PLAN.md`.
Reference implementation to port from: `docs/reference/`.
Before any submission or final review: `docs/06-SUBMISSION.md`.

MULTI-AGENT PROTOCOL (mandatory, full rules in `audit/README.md`):
- Read `audit/ACTIVE.md` FIRST, every session. It holds the file-ownership
  table, open blockers, and pending decisions. Do not edit a path another agent
  has claimed.
- Claim your paths in `audit/ACTIVE.md` before editing; release when done.
- Append a new file to `audit/log/` after any meaningful action. Append-only:
  never edit an existing entry. Name it `NNNN-cursor-<slug>.md`.
- Findings live in `audit/findings/FINDINGS.md` as F-NNN. Update Status when
  you fix one and cite the id in your log entry. Never delete a finding.

Cursor's role is **audit and fixtures**, tasks T6-T8. Claude Code owns T1-T5.
When reviewing, work through `docs/05-REVIEW-CHECKLIST.md` and report findings
as `[file:line] — finding — rubric criterion at risk`. Do not fix silently.

Invariants that must never be broken:
1. Money = integer minor units. Rates = integer basis points. No floats. CLP exponent 0.
2. `lib/calculator.ts` and `lib/rules.ts` are pure: no sqlite, no next/*, no clock.
3. `tax_rule_versions` is append-only and BITEMPORAL:
   effectiveFrom/effectiveTo -> selected by TRANSACTION DATE
   recordedAt/supersededAt   -> selected by AS-OF INSTANT
   Never merge the axes. Never mutate a rate in place.
4. Audit trail is immutable (SQLite triggers) and records every request including failures.
5. No applicable rule => 422 NO_APPLICABLE_RULE. Never a silent 0%.
6. Report aggregation in SQL, not in application memory.

Priority when trading off: accuracy (25) > audit (20) = rule versioning (20) >
API design (15) > code quality (10) = docs (10). There is no UI score; ignore
`app/page.tsx`.
